    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI inbox triage with human approval\n\nEvery new email: Claude classifies it, summarises it and drafts a reply. The draft goes to Slack with **Approve and send / Reject**. Only an approved reply is sent, in the same Gmail thread, to the original sender.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Credentials: Gmail OAuth2, Anthropic API, Slack (bot in the channel).\n2. Edit the **Settings** node.\n3. Activate.\n\nSafety: the email is treated as data; prompt-injection attempts and newsletters are never answered, only reported to Slack.\n\nFull version with CRM, document uploads, audit trail and evaluation: github.com/mtalhazia1/ai-ops",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "9960cef7-f761-52d1-b0fd-ce5a19d82680",
      "name": "About this template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -200
      ]
    }
